ter as doma says  she might have been the fastest hashera  doma ever saw which is saying a lot and  he said that before she succeeded in  outspeeding him and pinning him to the  roof so arguably she is the fastest  hashira he ever saw she was also very  intelligent and her mind was arguably  her most valuable weapon her knowledge  of toxins allowed her to not only help  beat doma but to help produce the toxin  that would ultimately help take down  muzon too and her long-planned strategy  against dolma was the single best  strategy i can think of in the entire  series it allowed her inosuke and kano  to defeat doma even though one upper  moon is supposed to be the equivalent of  three hashira and this isn't just one of  the upper moons we're talking about but  the second strongest one in straight up  strength i've placed shinobu below the  other hashira as you may have seen if  you watch my all hashtag rank from  weakest the strongest video gui had an  easy enough time overpowering her albeit  they probably weren't going full out but  he was able to first catch and then  restrain her furthermore most of the  other hashtags go on to unlock upgrades  like the demonstrator marks and red  blades while shinobu doesn't so my  ranking still pretty much stands but i  hope i've shown how much more there is  to a character than just strength  despite arguably being the weakest  hashira shinobu was one of the most  useful using her knowledge and sacrifice  to help defeat doma and even muzon she's  one of my favorite characters and we  should respect her more not less because  she was able to accomplish everything  she did while being one of the weaker  fighters among the hashira and that is  it for this one i really hope that i  added to your respect for shinobu  because she truly is one of my favorites  and so is her character arc simply  amazing if you did enjoy this video you  know what to do channel the slayer  within and smash that like button  remember i'll start on the n